00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:01,320
Yes

2
00:00:02,299 --> 00:00:04,980
I see now what my anger has wrought.

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,219
I told myself

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,920
that I had embraced the dark side willingly.

5
00:00:10,819 --> 00:00:13,840
That its power would free me from my suffering.

6
00:00:14,819 --> 00:00:18,290
But I am no more free now than I was before.